From 143ed22e468405b2cc01b35b46ee6975d4422628 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: husishu <husishu1@contributor>


Date: Tue, 27 Jan 2026 13:42:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] USERSTORY Dstore supports recyclebin

Issue:
-------
1.Recyclebin code merge into Dstore.
2.The recyclebin adapts to the Dstore engine.

Solution:
-----------
1.cherry-pick MRs related to the recyclebin
2.For adaptation to the Dstore engine:
ha_check_support_recyclebin is declared as a virtual function and is overridden in ha_cde and implemented in the same way as in InnoDB.

The DDClearInstantTable function is added to clear instant information. When a table is truncated, the instant information on columns needs to be cleared
